WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.650
Charter Section 15: Equality Rights.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:11.575
The Canadian Charter guarantees equality before and under the law without discrimination based on mental or physical disability.

00:00:11.575 --> 00:00:16.550
Two landmark Supreme Court decisions shaped the legal landscape for MAID.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:23.912
The government expanded eligibility despite constitutional protections designed to prevent exactly this outcome.
